me is wasted. Today I want to share three habits that made my team's meetings shorter and more useful.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Welcome back. These three habits can help make your team's meetings more productive.","calls":[],"decisionMs":514.2982080000002,"totalMs":514.305624999999,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":17,"timedOut":false},{"turn":16,"said":"The first habit is a written agenda. The day before each meeting, I send everyone a short list of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Got it. A written agenda is a powerful habit.","calls":[],"decisionMs":467.6185829999995,"totalMs":467.62595800000054,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":12,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"That's exactly right. When people know what to expect, the meeting runs more smoothly.","calls":[],"decisionMs":578.8075000000008,"totalMs":578.8145409999997,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":19,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"That's a great sign. It means the meetings are becoming a priority.","calls":[],"decisionMs":534.0350419999995,"totalMs":534.0461250000008,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":16,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"R